      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1357051022,
      "text": "Limonia acidissima is the only species within the monotypic genus Limonia. Common names for this South Asian species in English include wood-apple and elephant-apple. It is sometimes also called monkey fruit."
